Upstream attribution:

This package contains TypeScript code translated from the CRC-32 reference
at https://github.com/aeldidi/crc32 (crc32.c, crc32.h) by Ayman El Didi,
released under CC0 1.0 in 2020.

Algorithm: CRC-32 with polynomial 0xEDB88320 (reflected CRC-32-IEEE),
compatible with zlib, gzip, PNG, Ethernet, and SCTP-IEEE CRC32.
